    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Compare vertebral depth-to-length ratios with optimized cantilever designs under estimated loads, then model the strength-flexibility Pareto frontier and locate observed skeletons on it.";
